{"content":[{"c":["ASHURITE"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Probably a variant spelling for Asherite, a member of Asher’s tribe. The Ashurites were among those who supported Ishbosheth, Saul’s son, instead of David as king over Israel after Saul’s death (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.2.8-9","r":"2Sam.2.8-9","rawR":"2Sam.2.8-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.2.8-9","value":"2Sam.2.8-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 2:8-9"},"). In ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.27.6","r":"Ezek.27.6","rawR":"Ezek.27.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.27.6","value":"Ezek.27.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezekiel 27:6"}," (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},") the Hebrew word refers to a kind of wood rather than a group of people."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ashurite","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 2:8-9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.2.8-9","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.2.8-9","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.2.8-9"},{"anchorText":"Ezekiel 27:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.27.6","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.27.6","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.27.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"79dcb512cf9fca7ff78e7402d67a68e096a914571f909e622bc60f4839ead305","sourceItemName":"Ashurite","sourceItemOrder":555,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ashurite","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ashurite","title":"Ashurite","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}